<title>UK: Chubb Security H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Chubb Security H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Oct 11</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.91		   vs 9.60</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.86		   vs 2.60</p>
<p> Pretax		     46.1		   vs 44.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   427.4		  vs 383.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 46.5 and 48.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name is Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
